      "source": "Return the <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> associated with the web application,\nif it was initialized with one via\n<a href=\"WebHttpHandlerBuilder.html#applicationContext(org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext)\"><code>WebHttpHandlerBuilder.applicationContext(ApplicationContext)</code></a>.",
