    {
      "source": "An overloaded variant of <a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String,java.time.Instant)\"><code>ServerWebExchange.checkNotModified(String, Instant)</code></a> with\nan <code>ETag</code> (entity tag) value only.",
      "translation": "`ServerWebExchange.checkNotModified(String, Instant)` 的重载变体，仅包含一个 `<code>ETag</code>`（实体标签）值。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "An overloaded variant of <a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String,java.time.Instant)\"><code>ServerWebExchange.checkNotModified(String, Instant)</code></a> with\na last-modified timestamp only.",
      "translation": "带有最后修改时间戳的 `<a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#checkNotModified(java.lang.String,java.time.Instant)\"><code>ServerWebExchange.checkNotModified(String, Instant)</code></a>` 的重载变体。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The HTTP specification recommends setting both\nETag and Last-Modified values, but you can also use\n<code>#checkNotModified(String)</code> or\n<a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#checkNotModified(java.time.Instant)\"><code>ServerWebExchange.checkNotModified(Instant)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> HTTP 规范建议同时设置 ETag 和 Last-Modified 值，但您也可以使用<code>#checkNotModified(String)</code>或<a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#checkNotModified(java.time.Instant)\"><code>ServerWebExchange.checkNotModified(Instant)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Use of this method does not automatically create a session. See\n<a href=\"../WebSession.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebSession</code></a> for more details.",
      "translation": "使用此方法不会自动创建会话。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\"../WebSession.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.server\"><code>WebSession</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> calling this method causes the request body to\nbe read and parsed in full and the resulting <code>MultiValueMap</code> is\ncached so that this method is safe to call more than once.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 调用此方法会导致请求体被完整读取和解析，生成的 <code>MultiValueMap</code> 会被缓存，因此可以安全地多次调用此方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong>the <a href=\"../../../http/codec/multipart/Part.html#content()\">contents</a> of each\npart is not cached, and can only be read once.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong>每个部分的<a href=\"../../../http/codec/multipart/Part.html#content()\">内容</a>不会被缓存，且只能读取一次。",
      "count": 2
