      "source": "Transform the given url according to the registered transformation function(s).\nBy default, this method returns the given <code>url</code>, though additional\ntransformation functions can be registered with <a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#addUrlTransformer(java.util.function.Function)\"><code>ServerWebExchange.addUrlTransformer(Function)</code></a>",
