    {
      "source": "Returns <code>true</code> if the one of the <code>checkNotModified</code> methods\nin this contract were used and they returned true.",
      "translation": "如果此合约中的任一 `checkNotModified` 方法被调用且返回了 `true`，则返回 `<code>true</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a log message prefix to use to correlate messages for this exchange.\nThe prefix is based on the value of the attribute <a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#LOG_ID_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>ServerWebExchange.LOG_ID_ATTRIBUTE</code></a>\nalong with some extra formatting so that the prefix can be conveniently\nprepended with no further formatting no separators required.",
      "translation": "返回一个日志消息前缀，用于关联此交换的消息。该前缀基于属性 <a href=\"../ServerWebExchange.html#LOG_ID_ATTRIBUTE\"><code>ServerWebExchange.LOG_ID_ATTRIBUTE</code></a> 的值，并包含一些额外的格式化内容，以便可以方便地直接添加该前缀，无需进一步格式化或分隔符。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Cleans up any storage used for multipart handling.",
      "translation": "清理用于多部分处理的任何存储。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a mutable map of request attributes for the current exchange.",
      "translation": "返回当前交换的可变请求属性映射。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the authenticated user for the request, if any.",
      "translation": "如有，返回请求的已认证用户。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the current HTTP request.",
      "translation": "返回当前的 HTTP 请求。",
      "count": 2
