    {
      "source": "Always guaranteed to return either an instance matching the session id\nrequested by the client, or a new session either because the client did not\nspecify a session id or because the underlying session expired.",
      "translation": "始终保证返回与客户端请求的会话 ID 匹配的实例，或一个新的会话（因为客户端未指定会话 ID 或底层会话已过期）。",
      "count": 1
    },
